WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.220
Hi, I’m Kristian, owner of LUX.

00:02.430 --> 00:04.880
We built LUX Video OS to help businesses

00:04.930 --> 00:06.510
turn the things they need to say into

00:06.580 --> 00:08.440
professional videos, without organizing

00:08.490 --> 00:09.480
a shoot every time.

00:09.650 --> 00:10.730
Whether you’re introducing your

00:10.770 --> 00:12.190
business, explaining a service,

00:12.250 --> 00:13.790
promoting an offer, or answering a

00:13.850 --> 00:15.620
common customer question, the goal is to

00:15.690 --> 00:17.160
help you show up clearly and

00:17.230 --> 00:17.940
consistently.

00:18.320 --> 00:19.750
There are two ways to make a video.

00:19.910 --> 00:21.690
With LUX Standard, you are the face of

00:21.730 --> 00:22.310
the message.

00:22.520 --> 00:24.550
It uses your photo and voice, so

00:24.630 --> 00:26.650
customers see and hear the person behind

00:26.700 --> 00:27.270
the business.

00:27.530 --> 00:29.370
Choose Standard when that personal

00:29.430 --> 00:30.680
connection matters most.

00:30.980 --> 00:33.620
With LUX Premium, you can choose an AI

00:33.670 --> 00:35.830
presenter and voice to deliver a script

00:35.870 --> 00:36.470
you provide.

00:36.740 --> 00:38.170
It’s a good fit when you want a

00:38.230 --> 00:40.200
presenter to speak for your brand or

00:40.440 --> 00:41.960
you’d rather stay off camera.

00:42.420 --> 00:44.350
Both options help you get your message

00:44.390 --> 00:45.010
into video.

00:45.450 --> 00:47.330
The choice is simple: do you want to

00:47.390 --> 00:49.700
deliver it yourself, or have a presenter

00:49.770 --> 00:50.640
deliver it for you?

00:51.080 --> 00:52.980
Pick the one that fits your business and

00:53.040 --> 00:54.380
the message you want to share.
